      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"},
      "widgets_values": [
        "A minimalist game UI icon for a cultivation RPG, centered composition. Subject: a single stylized ancient bronze sword blade standing vertical in the center, the blade gracefully tapered with traditional Chinese sword cross-guard handle at the bottom, sharp clean metallic appearance with subtle bronze patina. The subject occupies about 60 percent of the canvas in the center, with generous empty space around. Behind the subject is a very simple thin uniform circular gold border ring, completely symmetric, no decoration on the ring itself. Pure clean solid white background, no other elements. Flat vector illustration style, painted with traditional Chinese ink wash brushstrokes but extremely simplified for icon use. Silver and ancient bronze color palette only, with metallic highlights along the blade edge. No animals, no creatures, no people, no characters, no complex patterns, no maze patterns, no ornate frames, no text, no multiple subjects, no snowflakes, no frost decoration, no leaves on border, no debris on border, no asymmetric elements. Single focal point on the sword. Designed to be readable when scaled down to 64x64 pixels. Symmetric and balanced composition. Highest quality concept art for game UI."
      ],
      "color": "#332",
      "bgcolor": "#553"
    },
