      "title": "土 Earth - 正面提示词",
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"},
      "widgets_values": [
        "A minimalist game UI icon for a cultivation RPG, centered composition. Subject: a single stylized triangular mountain peak shape in the center, solid and majestic, with subtle stone texture, base wider than top, like an ancient Chinese landscape painting mountain. The subject occupies about 60 percent of the canvas in the center, with generous empty space around. Behind the subject is a very simple thin uniform circular gold border ring, completely symmetric, no decoration on the ring itself. Pure clean solid white background, no other elements. Flat vector illustration style, painted with traditional Chinese ink wash brushstrokes but extremely simplified for icon use. Ochre yellow and earth brown color palette only, with subtle highlights suggesting sunlit stone surface. No animals, no creatures, no people, no characters, no complex patterns, no maze patterns, no ornate frames, no text, no multiple subjects, no snowflakes, no frost decoration, no leaves on border, no debris on border, no asymmetric elements, no trees on the mountain. Single focal point on the mountain peak. Designed to be readable when scaled down to 64x64 pixels. Symmetric and balanced composition. Highest quality concept art for game UI."
      ],
      "color": "#332",
      "bgcolor": "#543"
    },
